<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/ethiopian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ethiopian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ethiopian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Derg deposes Haile Selassie; the monarchy is abolished in March 1975</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/portuguese-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Portuguese%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Portuguese Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Carnation Revolution topples the dictatorship and opens the way to African independence</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/military-junta"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Military%20junta.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Military junta</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ethiopia’s military council, the Derg, deposes Emperor Haile Selassie and rules until 1987</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/presidential-democracy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Presidential%20democracy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Presidential democracy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Richard Nixon resigns as Congress moves to impeach him over the Watergate scandal</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/mehrgarh-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mehrgarh%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mehrgarh culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The French Archaeological Mission in the Indus Basin, led by Jean-François and Catherine Jarrige, discovers the site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hellenic-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hellenic%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hellenic Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Turkey invades Cyprus on 20 July after a Greek-backed coup; the junta collapses, Konstantinos Karamanlis returns and the first multiparty elections since 1964 are held.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/socialist-federal-republic-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Socialist%20Federal%20Republic%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The third constitution gives the republics and the provinces of Kosovo and Vojvodina wide autonomy; Tito is elected President-for-life.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Derg is established as the Coordinating Committee of the Armed Forces, Police and Territorial Army by junior and mid-level officers; announced on 28 June, it elects Major Mengistu Haile Mariam chairman.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 12 September the Derg deposes and imprisons Emperor Haile Selassie during nationwide protests; three days later it renames itself the Provisional Military Administrative Council.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 23 November the Derg removes and kills its chairman, Lieutenant General Aman Andom, with some of his supporters and 60 officials of the imperial government, the Massacre of the Sixty.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/nuragic-civilisation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nuragic%20civilisation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nuragic civilisation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Giants of Mont’e Prama are found near Cabras</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/environmental-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Environmental%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Environmental movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Chipko movement begins in India</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/maoism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Maoism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Maoism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">China announces its Three Worlds Theory at the United Nations</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/terracotta-army"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Terracotta%20Army.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Terracotta Army</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Farmers digging a well near Mount Li find the first figures, prompting archaeologists to investigate</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/haile-selassie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haile%20Selassie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haile Selassie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Derg, a committee of junior officers and enlisted men, deposes the 82-year-old emperor on 12 September</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Thiệu announces that the war has restarted, and China attacks South Vietnamese forces in the Paracel Islands and takes control of them</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mahavira"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mahavira.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mahavira</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jain sects hold a joint commemoration of the 2,500th anniversary of his nirvana</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/lisbon"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lisbon.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Lisbon</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Carnation Revolution, launched in Lisbon, ends the Estado Novo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/addis-ababa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Addis%20Ababa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Addis Ababa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Haile Selassie is deposed and the Derg takes power</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/black-consciousness-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Black%20Consciousness%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Black Consciousness Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Leaders are arrested under the Terrorism Act after rallies in support of the FRELIMO government in Mozambique</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/libertarianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Libertarianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Libertarianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Robert Nozick publishes Anarchy, State, and Utopia</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/tenrikyo"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tenrikyo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tenrikyo</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Tenrikyo reaches its high of 2,298,420 followers in Japan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/juche"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Juche.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Juche</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Kim Jong Il introduces Kimilsungism and the Ten Principles for the Establishment of a Monolithic Ideological System</span></li></ul></section>
